<section class="relative z-10 overflow-hidden py-20 sm:py-28 px-6" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a3d52 0%, #0d4a6b 60%, #0a5b8a 100%);">

  <!-- Grid overlay -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-5"
    style="background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 40px, #fff 40px, #fff 41px), repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, transparent 40px, #fff 40px, #fff 41px);">
  </div>

  <!-- Amber glow orb -->
  <div class="absolute -bottom-20 -right-20 w-96 h-96 rounded-full pointer-events-none opacity-30"
    style="background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,185,25,0.5) 0%, transparent 70%); filter: blur(60px);">
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 container mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
    
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 border border-white/20 rounded-full px-5 py-2 mb-8">
      <span class="text-amber-400 text-sm">🏐</span>
      <span class="text-white/90 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase">¿Listo para la Arena?</span>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black text-white leading-none mb-6">
      Tu Primer
      <span class="block text-transparent bg-clip-text" style="background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #FFB923, #ffd97a);">
        Entrenamiento
      </span>
      es Gratis.
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg sm:text-xl text-white/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
      Da el primer paso para dominar el vóley playa. Agenda tu clase de prueba hoy mismo y descubre tu potencial. Sin compromisos, solo pasión por el deporte.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
      <a href="https://wa.me/51929418895"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 font-black py-4 px-10 text-lg rounded-full shadow-[0_8px_30px_0_rgba(255,185,25,0.4)] hover:shadow-[0_12px_40px_0_rgba(255,185,25,0.6)] hover:scale-105 transform transition-all duration-300 active:scale-95 text-gray-900"
        style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB923, #ffd97a);"
      >
        <span>RESERVAR MI CLASE GRATIS</span>
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" /></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#contacto" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-2 border-white/30 text-white font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-full hover:border-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300">
        Más información
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Trust indicators -->
    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 text-white/50 text-sm">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-amber-400">✓</span> Sin contratos</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-amber-400">✓</span> Entrenadores certificados FIVB</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-amber-400">✓</span> Todas las edades</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>